 "description": "Find the age group for a birth date, governing body and season from published official cutoff rules. Covers US Youth Soccer, AYSO, The FA and Canada Soccer from 2026. Returns the cutoff source and calculator link. USYS and AYSO use the revised August\u2013July window from 2026\u201327.",
